# git-std hooks — pre-push.hooks
#
# Commands run during the pre-push hook before pushing to remote.
# Prefix controls behavior:
#
#   !  required   abort push on failure
#   ?  advisory   warn on failure, never abort
#
# Commands are skipped when a push contains only ref deletions.
# Add [delete] after the prefix to also run on deletion-only pushes:
#   ! [delete] ./scripts/check-ref-policy.sh
#
# Examples:
#   ! cargo test --workspace
#   ! npx markdownlint "**/*.md"
#
! just lint
